                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "2D platformer with action and survival elements, in which the player explores a gloomy world, avoiding traps and enemies\n\n✅The graphics are varied, sometimes colorful, sometimes dark\n✅The music also fits the game's atmosphere very well\n✅30 levels\n\n❌There's no character development or usable skills\n❌The hitboxes in this game are a joke. Sometimes a character or attack doesn't react in time, and you could die\n❌What good is 30 levels if they're terribly repetitive, they don't differ in any way, and after a while, I got bored\n❌The price is too high considering the repetition and bugs\n\n❌❌Verdict: [b] Very Bad [/b] , [strike] Bad [/strike] , [strike] Average [/strike] , [strike] Decent [/strike] , [strike] Good [/strike] , [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for tested games)\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask. Im happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!! Best regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer.",
